{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15101040","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15101040","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1510104001:1":{"text":"Here we are. Welcome to the Sandscript Temple.","source_cn":"到了，这里就是沙之书！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x244689D4DE9826A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510104002:1":{"text":"Wow... Look at the architecture! This place must be at least a thousand years old.","source_cn":"哇……看这里的建筑风格和剥落的墙面，少说有上千年的历史了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F5FF95FADE3905F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510104003:1":{"text":"More than that. <style=\"highlight\">Records of the Sandscript Temple can be traced back to ten thousand years ago.</style>","source_cn":"何止千年，这座<style=highlight>名为沙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD14F17C5BDE314B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1510104003":{"text":"More than that. <style=\"highlight\">Records of the Sandscript Temple can be traced back to ten thousand years ago.</style>","source_cn":"何止千年，这座<style=highlight>名为沙之书的殿堂，可以追溯至万年前</style>。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD14F17C5BDE314B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510104004:1":{"text":"Our ancestors built this temple at the summons of the High Priestess of that time. We were tasked to record the history of our clan.","source_cn":"嗯，万年前，我们部族的祖先在当时部落大祭司的号召下，建...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9F3A0BE2F0ADF36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510104005:1":{"text":"The walls bear inscriptions of everything the High Priestess saw: miracles, calamities... and the prophecy she uttered on her deathbed.","source_cn":"墙壁上刻画着大祭司所目见的一切：神迹、灾难……还有逝世...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC725876D7AC5A4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510104006:1":{"text":"Let's take a closer look.","source_cn":"咱们可以走近瞧瞧，但是记住——保持敬畏之心！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B47407BDB2F2B0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Ten thousand years!","source_cn":"一万年前？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB3ED9EA405967F70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Ten thousand years!","female":"Ten thousand years!","variant_male_record_index":"75372","variant_female_record_index":"75373","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"That's older than dirt...","source_cn":"那么久远？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x12C60092EF93DD26","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's older than dirt...","female":"T